          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 150,
          "diagram": "b1-e41-computers-at-school",
          "text": "A school has some money to spend on new equipment. Here are some things it could buy. Talk together about the different things, and say which would be the best for the students.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e41-computers-at-school/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
